    <briefdescription>
<para>Composite instrument </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This instrument is an aggregate of other instruments. Its NPV is the sum of the NPVs of its components, each possibly multiplied by a given factor.</para><para><bold>Example: </bold> static replication of a down-and-out barrier option </para><para><xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000052"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>Methods that drive the calculation directly (such as recalculate(), freeze() and others) might not work correctly.</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
